  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "🎣 BigFish · AI 钓鱼助手",
      "text": "钓点分析 · 鱼情分析 · 钓点分享。拍水面分析鱼情，结合天气气压推荐鱼种·钓法·饵料。支持路亚、台钓、野钓、海钓，自动记录渔获和出钓报告。\n\n> English: AI fishing assistant: spot analysis, fish activity, bait/lure recommendations, fishing log."
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ 功能",
      "text": "详见 [SKILL.md](SKILL.md) 完整说明。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔧 环境依赖",
      "text": "纯知识库驱动（4 个 YAML），无需脚本依赖；天气数据建议配合 weather 类工具。"
    },
    {
      "section": "📥 安装（DeepSeek Harness / dsh）",
      "text": "本技能遵循 **Agent Skills 开放标准**（SKILL.md + YAML frontmatter），适用于 DeepSeek Harness (dsh)、OpenClaw、Claude Code 等支持 Agent Skills 的框架。\n\n```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：放入用户级共享目录（推荐）",
      "text": "mkdir -p ~/.agents\ngit clone https://github.com/kobenfang/bigfish.git ~/.agents/bigfish"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：放入项目目录",
      "text": "mkdir -p .agents\ncp -r bigfish .agents/\n```\n\ndsh 启动后即可在技能列表中找到 `bigfish`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔍 搜索关键词",
      "text": "钓鱼, 鱼情, 钓点, 路亚, 台钓, 饵料, fishing, angling, lure"
    },
    {
      "section": "📄 目录结构",
      "text": "```\nbigfish/\n├── SKILL.md          # 技能定义（Agent Skills 标准）\n├── scripts/knowledge/bait-recipes.yaml\n├── scripts/knowledge/fish-species.yaml"
    },
